+### The command's one interpreter call
+
+The learn command, not any agent, checks each `.jsonl` file line by line
+with `python3` running the script whose exact text is in
+`commands/learn.md` Step 9, written to `$RUN_TMP` and fed the file list
+through `xargs -0 -r`. That is the only interpreter any part of the learn
+family starts. No learn agent has Bash.
